  "title": "The wrong way to use DORA Metrics",
  "summary": "Are you using DORA metrics as intended? Google says you might not be! While these metrics are valuable indicators, their misinterpretation or narrow focus can lead to detrimental outcomes, such as neglecting broader business goals, overlooking human factors, and fostering cultural misalignment. By understanding the nuanced nature of these metrics and their relationship to organizational objectives, leaders can better leverage them to enhance developer experience and overall productivity.",
